{
 "title": "The bad day rule",
 "chapter": "Build It the Size You Can Actually Carry",
 "length": 45.0,
 "lines": [
  {
   "at": 0.12,
   "text": "Your plan only works on good days."
  },
  {
   "beat": 4,
   "text": "That's why it keeps breaking."
  },
  {
   "beat": 8,
   "text": "Monday, you crush it. Tuesday too."
  },
  {
   "beat": 14,
   "text": "Then one bad day hits."
  },
  {
   "beat": 17,
   "text": "No sleep. No energy. No mood."
  },
  {
   "beat": 22,
   "text": "The plan breaks. And so does the streak."
  },
  {
   "beat": 26.5,
   "text": "So build it for your worst day."
  },
  {
   "beat": 31,
   "text": "Step one. Pick the goal."
  },
  {
   "beat": 34,
   "text": "Step two. Shrink it until it's embarrassing."
  },
  {
   "beat": 39,
   "text": "Step three. That's your floor."
  },
  {
   "beat": 42,
   "text": "Step four. Never go below it.",
   "speed": 1.15
  },
  {
   "beat": 45,
   "text": "Gym. Ten pushups.",
   "speed": 1.22
  },
  {
   "beat": 47,
   "text": "Reading. One page.",
   "speed": 1.22
  },
  {
   "beat": 49.1,
   "text": "Business. One message.",
   "speed": 1.22
  },
  {
   "beat": 51.25,
   "text": "Running. Shoes on. One kilometer.",
   "speed": 1.22
  },
  {
   "beat": 55,
   "text": "On a good day, do more."
  },
  {
   "beat": 58,
   "text": "On a bad day, do the floor."
  },
  {
   "beat": 61,
   "text": "Either way, the streak never breaks."
  },
  {
   "beat": 67,
   "text": "A plan that only works when you feel like it, isn't a plan.",
   "speed": 1.15
  },
  {
   "beat": 73,
   "text": "It's a mood with a deadline."
  },
  {
   "beat": 76,
   "text": "Never go below the floor."
  }
 ],
